<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia February unemployment eases to 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia February unemployment eases to 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT    Feb    Jan     Feb 96</p>
<p>    Percentage		    14.5   14.6     14.2</p>
<p>    Total			125,534  126,316  123,689</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
